A union variant that is a named array, of items that validate, is validated item by
item, as a field of that array is: an Option whose name is shorter than its
minLength fails Validate there too, where the variant was not checked
(0049-MADR-remediate-the-2026-11-01-debugging-pass.md, G19, Q25 a).

